Rev 3:1 , The angel of the church of Sardis is reproved;
Rev 3:3 , exhorted to repent, and threatened if he do not repent;
Rev 3:8 , The angel of the church of Philadelphia
Rev 3:10 . is approved for his diligence and patience;
Rev 3:15 , the angel of Laodicea rebuked for being neither hot nor cold
Rev 3:19 . and admonished to be more zealous;
Rev 3:20 , Christ stands at the door and knocks.
